    {
      "id": "ba165e16-458e-4aa2-b4e1-e913346ed544",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe como o marcador temporal abre a frase sem complicar a resposta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "dcac454b-ed91-4008-8cc2-c52e18b9e9c5",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ayer</strong> coloca a fala imediatamente no ontem.</p><p><strong>Compré</strong> já entrega a ação principal sem precisar de outra frase.</p><p><strong>Café</strong> fecha a resposta com um detalhe concreto, útil para um ensaio oral curto.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b654e20c-f5f4-41f1-ad25-0b7f89fc5c8d",
      "title": "Escute a linha e note como o sentido muda sem deixar a resposta mais longa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "08f4328e-0bfb-4e7c-ac8e-747c7210e373",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora escute outra linha curta.</p><p><strong>Anoche salí tarde.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Ontem à noite saí tarde.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5806de550a344061aeffcd7261a0e4da_b04-anoche-sali-tarde.mp3?Expires=1794099539&Signature=nqiCRqzCnsi7o22FHeQ72PyTFNCw2-DW5~BWFHFYVcj8eLWukC5c~hs7xqX6MH-XkTIXGzxeeIg5WoXPQBS2oOPyPMHcTyuDhV5WjHEg5II6aG0q92vicnK04stK3POJRWVSL8DO834Oe6WcQj~UxQOAJronfMfEQ55OYaTwIaJJajcCrZQ9AwUwYCmQHuQF1D-0l6yJHawgWx2-AIcX0LL4eG05DsdRywoNhx5Tw00d~tSE3tDl5j7i806rxz7O8oKuera6k77Hfh09aEn9LVIjboIZpVXeqp9~tXOLB4arYGEryRFDbtrKmo2dnWaZZRfbF4OV7qyt7iYxnCvE9w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
